WEBVTT

00:10:27.917 --> 00:10:30.632
because I'm thinking you're anhedonic,
you feel powerless,

00:10:30.656 --> 00:10:32.851
you feel hopeless, you feel helpless.

00:10:32.875 --> 00:10:35.393
You have no energy,
no sense of meaning, no purpose.

00:10:35.417 --> 00:10:38.226
It's a, how can that person
have the power?

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:42.809
And then they said, "Because that person,
through their impotence,

00:10:42.833 --> 00:10:46.726
is actually activating
the competence of everybody else

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.518
who is trying to lift them

00:10:48.542 --> 00:10:50.268
to whom they end up saying, 'No,'

00:10:50.292 --> 00:10:52.309
to everything they suggest to them.

00:10:52.333 --> 00:10:55.809
And in the end, the competent people
feel as defeated and deflated

00:10:55.833 --> 00:10:57.143
as the depressed one.

00:10:57.167 --> 00:10:58.434
That is power."

00:10:58.458 --> 00:10:59.726
AG: Wow.

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.226
EP: That was a moment for me
where I began to think,